Both failures are the pre-existing, shared `maturity-tier` aggregate
exact-count assertion going stale from concurrent sibling landings in
this batch (see Consequences above), not a defect in this ADR's own
registry edit or deftest -- this occupation's own dedicated deftest
passes standalone (1 test / 3 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors).
